<ttl id="10008_S000M_744FW_T006I" variety="T006I">
<name>Vacuum Switching Valve Assembly (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM0000020W4008X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="090SY-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM0000020W4008X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000020W4008X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00003RE00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Vacuum Switching Valve Assembly NO.1</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A128942J02" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>23 to 26Ω(20°C) </ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Operation Check</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Apply battery voltage between the terminals of the vacuum switching valve assembly No.1, and check for air flow between each port when the coil is energized and not energized.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Energized Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Energized</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Air flows</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not energized</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No air flow</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
